# DNA Methylation-Based Cancer Diagnostics: Company Landscape

> Regulatory status as of early 2026.  
> **Abbreviations** — Chemistry: BSC = bisulfite conversion; MS-PCR = methylation-specific PCR; IP = immunoprecipitation. Scope: LP = large panel (>10K CpG sites); SP = small panel (<1K CpG sites/regions). LDT = laboratory-developed test (CLIA-certified, not FDA-cleared).

---

